        "created_at": "2015-04-14T16:10:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I love you guys. Even if you're OBVIOUSLY wrong about Bunker.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I wanted to run a Sentinels game, so I love that I don't have to reinvent the wheel! Awesome.</p>",
