      {
        "id": 138205,
        "name": "Alex",
        "username": "Alex",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/alex/{size}/2059_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-14T19:51:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"slaaneshi611\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n slaaneshi611:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;If you're willing to run by forum, I'm perfectly happy to play. 5e is really good and the combat improvements are very welcome.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Wait, you can do that? I mean, I GMed other games here, but I always figured D&amp;D was too complicated. How do you coordinate this?</p>",
