        "created_at": "2015-04-14T23:10:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wouldn't recommend running on the GtG forums without their permission, but as Ameena said, you can run pretty much anything on a forum. It lends itself more to narrative and character driven stories, in my experience, but it's totally possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edited for clarity.</p>",
