      {
        "id": 138208,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-15T16:02:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>GtG has said they are okay with it, so long as the threads are all in <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forums/off-topic\">the Off Topic forum</a>.</p>\n<p>Try not to create too many threads, too, okay? Don't want to completely take over OT.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\">  If you find you really need a lot of threads (let's say more than 3), let a Mod know and we'll figure out options for you.</p>",
