      {
        "id": 138209,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-15T20:15:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There are plenty of other sites you can use if you want to run a forum-based RPG anyway - I've mentioned RPOL, which is a site specifically dedicated to hosting forum-based games. There's another site called Obsidian Portal which isn't so much a place to play games as a repository for GMs (and, if the GM has given permisison, the players) to store all their game info and maps and anything else.</p>",
