      {
        "id": 138210,
        "name": "Belle Sorciere",
        "username": "Belle_Sorciere",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/belle_sorciere/{size}/1982_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-17T03:05:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So many RPGs. I'd say my favorites have been White Wolf's WoD, Trinity-Aberrant-Adventure!, Scion, Exalted, Scarred Lands. From others: Feng Shui, Fading Suns, Mutants &amp; Masterminds, Icons, BASH!, Shadowrun, Earthdawn, and Eclipse Phase.</p>\n<p>Fate is currently my favorite thing, although I haven't played much of it yet. The closest I've come is running an Icons game (which is some kind of Fate hybrid), but I am leaning toward straight up Fate, esp. Mecha vs. Kaiju, The Dresden Files, Nova Praxis, several more I am forgetting, and the Fate game being done for the superhero fiction series <span class=\"bbcode-b\">Wearing the Cape</span>.</p>",
