        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-18T20:05:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cartoon Action Hour is pretty brilliant. &nbsp;I played a game at Origins run by one of the editors, using characters from He-Man and the Masters of the Universe. &nbsp;</p><p>That session may be one of the best convention games I've played, in a week marked by Venture Brothers-Paranoia and Golden Age JSA-ICONS.</p>",
